,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI升级Codex安全防护体系，新增危险操作拦截与权限控制机制</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">MiniMax发布生产力工具MiniMax Design，支持自然语言驱动视频创作</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta推出Mac版Meta AI桌面应用，支持屏幕共享与语音输入功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">宇树科技发布仿生7轴灵巧机械臂R1，起售价9900元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/005ab36362d1cc71b0d0346919812c2d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">宇树科技于8月20日正式发布仿生7轴灵巧机械臂R1，起售价定为9900元。该产品采用七轴联动设计，重复定位精度达0.1毫米，最大臂展650毫米，额定负载2公斤，整机自重仅5.5公斤。R1内置力反馈与碰撞检测功能，支持位置与力矩混合控制，基于Ubuntu环境开发，配备XT30与CAN485接口，官方计划后续开源控制程序及接口。硬件方面，R1支持快速换装夹爪或灵巧手，适用于科研教育、工业装配、移动平台运维及服务机器人等场景。宇树科技强调，R1定位民用，用户需注意其关节减速比较低，动态作业时需针对性优化控制策略以减少位置误差。该产品的推出显著降低了高性能多轴机器人的部署门槛，支持桌面级即放即用，为开发者提供了高性价比的自动化实验与开发平台。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Stripe以75亿美元收购AI模型路由平台OpenRouter</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3e893bf76cd8ff854c424e8e29d4993e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">全球支付巨头Stripe正式确认以75亿美元收购AI模型路由与网关平台OpenRouter，该交易金额较OpenRouter今年5月B轮融资时的13亿美元估值增长超5倍。OpenRouter作为AI底层基础设施，提供统一API入口，支持将请求动态路由至400至500个主流模型，目前拥有超1000万用户，日处理token量突破10万亿。合并后，OpenRouter将保持原名称独立运营，核心产品路线图不变。此次收购旨在将模型选择与路由机制深度集成至Stripe的支付计量栈中，通过整合支付系统与推理路由层，Stripe意在卡位智能体（Agent）经济下的token消耗流管理，实现对AI消费与智能经济运转核心节点的掌控。交易预计在未来数周内完成交割。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI升级Codex安全防护体系，新增危险操作拦截与权限控制机制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d31c874a40da853b25b61f2dbfa23f9f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日宣布升级AI编程代理Codex的安全防护体系，旨在降低代理在执行代码任务时误删文件或覆盖数据的风险。针对此前调查发现的系统变量复用（如$HOME变量误用）及路径校验缺失问题，OpenAI采取了多项强化措施：新版Codex要求代理在执行敏感操作前必须验证目标路径，并强制使用独立临时目录以规避系统变量干扰。同时，系统强化了危险命令的识别与拦截机制，并增设了操作审核流程。在权限管理方面，OpenAI提高了Codex Full access权限的准入门槛，通过增加风险提示和升级Auto-review规则，在保障编程效率的同时，有效控制了AI Agent在文件管理和自动化任务中的安全隐患。此次升级标志着AI编程代理在向复杂任务演进过程中，权限控制与操作审计能力正成为核心技术壁垒。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">MiniMax发布生产力工具MiniMax Design，支持自然语言驱动视频创作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/56f861e41fbe88ccc0cdfe84ae21bebd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">8月20日，MiniMax正式发布生产力工具MiniMax Design，该产品基于原生多模态视频模型H3构建，旨在实现从“操作像素”到“操作语义”的创作范式转变。用户通过自然语言表达创作意图，系统即可自动拆解任务并完成从素材生成到成片的交付。H3模型赋予了该工具强大的多模态理解与参考控制能力，能够处理剧本、角色资产及用户风格偏好等复杂项目级上下文。在商业应用层面，MiniMax Design支持品牌批量生成营销素材、教案转短视频及“3D导演台”镜头预演。为提升灵活性，该工具支持接入ComfyUI等开源生态工作流，允许创作者在云端或本地进行参数微调。通过Agent驱动的工作流，MiniMax Design有效解决了多模态模型在工业化生产中的可控性与连贯性难题。目前，该产品已正式开放下载，用户可访问design.</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta推出Mac版Meta AI桌面应用，支持屏幕共享与语音输入功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bde9e51a48b2b8d4a638ea31b6473075.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式推出Mac版Meta AI桌面应用，旨在强化AI在生产力场景的交互能力。该应用核心功能包括屏幕窗口共享，允许AI实时理解屏幕内容并提供建议或生成内容；同时支持跨应用语音输入，用户可在其他软件中直接通过语音完成听写任务。此次更新标志着Meta AI从问答工具向智能生产力助手转型，以应对ChatGPT、Gemini及Claude等竞品的竞争。此外，Meta AI现已实现网页、移动端与Mac端的全平台协同，并深度集成Instagram、Facebook账号及Google Workspace。企业用户可利用该助手分析社交内容数据、生成演示文稿与文档，并自动执行周度业绩报告等业务任务。通过整合多模态交互、数据连接与自动化能力，Meta正加速提升其AI产品在办公与创作工作流中的竞争力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
